href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"58-df-module\">58-df-module</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S\\)</span> (module-homomorphism predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"25e593b1b8714c23\" href=\"?note=25e593b1b8714c23\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injective}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Injective}_S\\)</span> (injection predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8317eefb4572709e\" href=\"?note=8317eefb4572709e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-injective.md\">../batch15/58-df-injective.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InjectiveModule}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{InjectiveModule}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}injective\\text{-}module} \\vdash \\mathrm{InjectiveModule}_S(E,R)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Module}(E,R)\\land\\forall M,N,i,f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Module}(M,R)\\land\\operatorname{Module}(N,R)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S(i,M,N,R)\\land\\mathrm{Injective}_S(i,M,N)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S(f,M,E,R)\\to\\exists g\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S(g,N,E,R)\\land g\\circ i=f)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}injective\\text{-}module} \\vdash \\mathrm{InjectiveModule}_S(E,R)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Module}(E,R)\\land\\forall M,N,i,f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Module}(M,R)\\land\\operatorname{Module}(N,R)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S(i,M,N,R)\\land\\mathrm{Injective}_S(i,M,N)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S(f,M,E,R)\\to\\exists g\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S(g,N,E,R)\\land g\\circ i=f)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Injective module: every homomorphism extends</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-algebra2-injective-module</code> is merged here.</li>\n<li>The Ext vanishing condition is a standard characterization, not the defining clause here.</li>\n<li>Baer criterion: test injectivity with cyclic modules</li>\n<li>Injective hull: divisible envelope of module</li>\n<li>Divisible modules over PIDs are injective</li>\n<li>Injective objects in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>-Mod form an abelian category</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Lam, Lectures on Modules and Rings</li>\n<li>Rotman, An Introduction to Homological Algebra</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-module","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-module]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"25e593b1b8714c23","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-injective.md","status":"resolved","id":"8317eefb4572709e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-injective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-module","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Module}$ (module 